hat before the end of the decade, it [will have invested] more than $5 billion in improvements to the country's transport system. (&lt;i&gt;invest&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1121.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>The government estimates that before the end of the decade, it &lt;b&gt;will have invested&lt;/b&gt; more than $5 billion in improvements to the country's transport system.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: I rang the doorbell a few times but David didn't answer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: Knowing David, he [will have been playing] his music really loud so he probably couldn't hear you. (&lt;i&gt;play&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1122.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: I rang the doorbell a few times but David didn't answer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: Knowing David, he &lt;b&gt;will have been playing&lt;/b&gt; his music really loud so he probably couldn't hear you.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>I hope that she [will have repaid] the money she owes me by the end of the month. (&lt;i&gt;repay&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1123.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>I hope that she &lt;b&gt;will have repaid&lt;/b&gt; the money she owes me by the end of the month.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>true</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>true</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>Unless inflation begins to fall soon the Finance Minister's reputation for his expert management of the economy [will have been damaged]. (&lt;i&gt;damage&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1124.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>Unless inflation begins to fall soon the Finance Minister's reputation for his expert management of the economy &lt;b&gt;will have been damaged&lt;/b&gt;.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: Joanne said she was too busy to go out last night.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: That's because she [will have been revising]. Her exams start next week. (&lt;i&gt;revise&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1125.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>&lt;b&gt;A&lt;/b&gt;: Joanne said she was too busy to go out last night.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;: That's because she &lt;b&gt;will have been revising&lt;/b&gt;. Her exams start next week.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>Calls for the decommissioning of the nuclear reactor will reach their peak in the spring of next year when it [will have been operating] for 50 years. (&lt;I&gt;operate&lt;/I&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1126.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>Calls for the decommissioning of the nuclear reactor will reach their peak in the spring of next year when it &lt;b&gt;will have been operating&lt;/b&gt; for 50 years.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>If the space telescope can't be repaired soon, we [will have wasted] over $100 million. (&lt;i&gt;waste&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1127.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>If the space telescope can't be repaired soon, we &lt;b&gt;will have wasted&lt;/b&gt; over $100 million.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>After she finishes school in July, Sophie is going to work in Zimbabwe for six months. By the time she gets back home in January, most of her school friends [will have gone] to college or university. (&lt;i&gt;go&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1128.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>After she finishes school in July, Sophie is going to work in Zimbabwe for six months. By the time she gets back home in January, most of her school friends &lt;b&gt;will have gone&lt;/b&gt; to college or university.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>By the end of the week the 50 applicants for the post [will have been reduced] to a short list of just five. (&lt;i&gt;reduce&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/1129.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>By the end of the week the 50 applicants for the post &lt;b&gt;will have been reduced&lt;/b&gt; to a short list of just five.</modelAnswerString></question><question ignorePunctuation="false" ignoreCase="false"><ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun>false</ignoreCaseExceptIPronoun><ignorePunctuationWithExceptions>false</ignorePunctuationWithExceptions><text>It's taking Pedro a lot longer to finish his house than he expected. By next month he [will have been building] it for three years. (&lt;i&gt;build&lt;/i&gt;)</text><label /><audioURL>learning_objects/assets/11210.mp3</audioURL><skipPrefix>false</skipPrefix><isExample>false</isExample><modelAnswerString>It's taking Pedro a lot longer to finish his house than he expected. By next month he &lt;b&gt;will have been building&lt;/b&gt; it for three years.</modelAnswerString></question></question_xml><enableAudioOnChecked>false</enableAudioOnChecked><enableAudioOnClosed>true</enableAudioOnClosed><correctFeedback_str /><incorrectFeedback_str /><attemptsAllowed>1</attemptsAllowed></mcq_xml></params_xml><alignment>none</alignment><alignPercent>100</alignPercent><custom_style_name /><sharedTokenBankId /><is_sequential>False</is_sequential><is_compulsory>False</is_compulsory><states><state id="queued" visible="True" enabled="False" /><state id="in_progress" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="complete" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="checked" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="closed" visible="True" enabled="True" /></states></params></object><object linkID="background_image"><params><imageURL>learning_objects/assets/agu_filler.png</imageURL><horizontalAlign>center</horizontalAlign><verticalAlign>bottom</verticalAlign><custom_style_name /><sharedTokenBankId /><is_sequential>False</is_sequential><is_compulsory>False</is_compulsory><states><state id="queued" visible="True" enabled="False" /><state id="in_progress" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="complete" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="checked" visible="True" enabled="True" /><state id="closed" visible="Tru